 class=\"v-m\">迫害；压迫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"144057\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人々<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとびと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>宗教<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>により<ruby>迫害<rp>(</rp><rt>はくがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他以宗教的方式迫害了人们。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">拍手</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はくしゅ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">拍手；鼓掌；（在神社参拜时）拍手祈祷；击掌参拜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"210747\">その<ruby>公演<rp>(</rp><rt>こうえん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>万雷<rp>(</rp><rt>ばんらい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>拍手<rp>(</rp><rt>はくしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">演出得到了万雷的赞扬。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">薄弱</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はくじゃく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">虚弱；软弱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">白状</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はくじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坦白；供认；认罪</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"118664\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>あやま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ちをあからさまに