 lang=\"zh-Hans\">这里没有小牙齿。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">派遣</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はけん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">派遣；派出；部署；临时员工；派遣员工；临时工</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"101616\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>特派員<rp>(</rp><rt>とくはいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>として<ruby>海外<rp>(</rp><rt>かいがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>派遣<rp>(</rp><rt>はけん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他被派往国外作为特使。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">激しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はげしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">猛烈的；凶猛的；狂暴的；极端的；激烈的；强烈的；热烈的；强烈的；不间断的；持续不断的；陡峭的；险峻的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"213458\">その２チームは<ruby>激<rp>(</rp><rt>はげ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しく<ruby>戦<rp>(</rp><rt>たたか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两支球队都战得很激烈。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">励ます</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はげます</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">鼓励；给...打气；使...高兴；提高（嗓音）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207769\">その<ruby>調子<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>続<rp>(</rp><rt>つづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けなさいと<ruby>